[
    {
        "title": "Problema 1: Suma de Dos Números",
        "description": "<p>Escribe una función llamada <code>solve(a, b)</code> que tome dos números enteros <code>a</code> y <code>b</code> como argumentos y devuelva su suma.</p><p><strong>Ejemplo:</strong></p><pre>solve(5, 3)  # Debería devolver 8</pre>",
        "difficulty": "Fácil",
        "starterCode": "def solve(a, b):\n    # Escribe tu código aquí\n    return 0\n",
        "testCode": "results = []\ntests = [(1, 2, 3), (5, 5, 10), (-1, 1, 0), (100, 200, 300), (-50, -25, -75)]\n\nfor i, (a, b, expected) in enumerate(tests):\n    try:\n        result = solve(a, b)\n        if result == expected:\n            results.append(f\"Test {i+1} (solve({a}, {b})): <span class='text-green-400'>PASSED</span>\")\n        else:\n            raise Exception(f\"Resultado incorrecto. Se esperaba {expected}, pero se obtuvo {result}\")\n    except Exception as e:\n        results.append(f\"Test {i+1} (solve({a}, {b})): <span class='text-red-400'>FAILED</span> - {e}\")\n\nif all(\"<span class='text-green-400'>PASSED</span>\" in res for res in results):\n    print(\"__SUCCESS__\")\nelse:\n    print(\"__FAILURE__:\\n\" + \"\\n\".join(results))\n"
    },
    {
        "title": "Problema 2: Encontrar el Número Máximo",
        "description": "<p>Escribe una función llamada <code>solve(numbers)</code> que tome una lista de números <code>numbers</code> y devuelva el número más grande de la lista.</p><p>Si la lista está vacía, devuelve <code>None</code>.</p><p><strong>Ejemplo:</strong></p><pre>solve([1, 5, 2, 9, 3])  # Debería devolver 9</pre>",
        "difficulty": "Fácil",
        "starterCode": "def solve(numbers):\n    # Escribe tu código aquí\n    if not numbers:\n        return None\n    return 0\n",
        "testCode": "results = []\ntests = [([1, 5, 2, 9, 3], 9), ([-10, -5, -2], -2), ([5], 5), ([], None), ([1, 1, 1], 1)]\n\nfor i, (arg, expected) in enumerate(tests):\n    try:\n        result = solve(arg)\n        if result == expected:\n            results.append(f\"Test {i+1}: <span class='text-green-400'>PASSED</span>\")\n        else:\n            raise Exception(f\"Resultado incorrecto. Se esperaba {expected}, pero se obtuvo {result}\")\n    except Exception as e:\n        results.append(f\"Test {i+1}: <span class='text-red-400'>FAILED</span> - {e}\")\n\nif all(\"<span class='text-green-400'>PASSED</span>\" in res for res in results):\n    print(\"__SUCCESS__\")\nelse:\n    print(\"__FAILURE__:\\n\" + \"\\n\".join(results))\n"
    },
    {
        "title": "Problema 3: Revertir una Cadena",
        "description": "<p>Escribe una función <code>solve(s)</code> que tome una cadena <code>s</code> y devuelva la cadena al revés.</p><p><strong>Ejemplo:</strong></p><pre>solve(\"hola\")  # Debería devolver \"aloh\"</pre>",
        "difficulty": "Fácil",
        "starterCode": "def solve(s):\n    # Escribe tu código aquí\n    return \"\"\n",
        "testCode": "results = []\ntests = [(\"hola\", \"aloh\"), (\"Python\", \"nohtyP\"), (\"a\", \"a\"), (\"\", \"\")]\n\nfor i, (arg, expected) in enumerate(tests):\n    try:\n        result = solve(arg)\n        if result == expected:\n            results.append(f\"Test {i+1}: <span class='text-green-400'>PASSED</span>\")\n        else:\n            raise Exception(f\"Resultado incorrecto. Se esperaba '{expected}', pero se obtuvo '{result}'\")\n    except Exception as e:\n        results.append(f\"Test {i+1}: <span class='text-red-400'>FAILED</span> - {e}\")\n\nif all(\"<span class='text-green-400'>PASSED</span>\" in res for res in results):\n    print(\"__SUCCESS__\")\nelse:\n    print(\"__FAILURE__:\\n\" + \"\\n\".join(results))\n"
    },
    {
        "title": "Problema 4: Comprobar Palíndromo",
        "description": "<p>Escribe una función <code>solve(s)</code> que devuelva <code>True</code> si la cadena <code>s</code> es un palíndromo (se lee igual al derecho y al revés) y <code>False</code> si no lo es.</p><p>Ignora mayúsculas/minúsculas y espacios.</p><p><strong>Ejemplo:</strong></p><pre>solve(\"Ana\")  # Debería devolver True\nsolve(\"Anita lava la tina\") # Debería devolver True</pre>",
        "difficulty": "Fácil",
        "starterCode": "def solve(s):\n    # Escribe tu código aquí\n    return False\n",
        "testCode": "results = []\ntests = [(\"Ana\", True), (\"Anita lava la tina\", True), (\"casa\", False), (\"\", True), (\"a\", True), (\"racecar\", True)]\n\ndef run_test(s, expected):\n    try:\n        # La función del usuario debe encargarse de procesar la cadena\n        result = solve(s)\n        if result == expected:\n            return f\"Test (solve('{s}')): <span class='text-green-400'>PASSED</span>\"\n        else:\n            raise Exception(f\"Resultado incorrecto. Se esperaba {expected}, pero se obtuvo {result}\")\n    except Exception as e:\n        return f\"Test (solve('{s}')): <span class='text-red-400'>FAILED</span> - {e}\"\n\nfor t in tests:\n    results.append(run_test(t[0], t[1]))\n\nif all(\"<span class='text-green-400'>PASSED</span>\" in res for res in results):\n    print(\"__SUCCESS__\")\nelse:\n    print(\"__FAILURE__:\\n\" + \"\\n\".join(results))\n"
    },
    {
        "title": "Problema 5: Factorial de un Número",
        "description": "<p>Escribe una función <code>solve(n)</code> que devuelva el factorial de un número <code>n</code>. El factorial de 0 es 1.</p><p><strong>Ejemplo:</strong></p><pre>solve(5)  # Debería devolver 120 (5*4*3*2*1)</pre>",
        "difficulty": "Fácil",
        "starterCode": "def solve(n):\n    # Escribe tu código aquí\n    return 1\n",
        "testCode": "results = []\ntests = [(5, 120), (0, 1), (1, 1), (7, 5040)]\n\nfor i, (arg, expected) in enumerate(tests):\n    try:\n        result = solve(arg)\n        if result == expected:\n            results.append(f\"Test {i+1}: <span class='text-green-400'>PASSED</span>\")\n        else:\n            raise Exception(f\"Resultado incorrecto. Se esperaba {expected}, pero se obtuvo {result}\")\n    except Exception as e:\n        results.append(f\"Test {i+1}: <span class='text-red-400'>FAILED</span> - {e}\")\n\nif all(\"<span class='text-green-400'>PASSED</span>\" in res for res in results):\n    print(\"__SUCCESS__\")\nelse:\n    print(\"__FAILURE__:\\n\" + \"\\n\".join(results))\n"
    },
    {
